SUMMARY:The Friday Night Mix\, Mingle\, Dinner and Live Music Party!
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nI'd like to in
 vite you out to our **Friday Night Mix\, MIngle\, Dinnner and Live Music P
 arty!**\n\n-Reserved seating\, friendly people\, good conversation and gre
 at food awaits!\n\n\\*Remember to ask for Steve when you arrive-so they ca
 n point you to the group\n(you will be paying your fee to me not the perso
 n at the front door-much appreciated)\n\n*\\*Joined by my other social gro
 ups too so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\n**Date:** Friday\, S
 eptember 25th 2026\n**Arrival Time:** Please arrive between 6:30 p.m. -8:0
 0 p.m. (if you can)\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Location:** Smoke Show\n**Ad
 dress:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parking:** in Residential area and on Eg
 linton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant Sub
 way:** (Very close\, 1 minute walking distance)\n\nEvent Details Bellow:\n
 \nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**The
  Friday Night Mix\, Mingle\, Dinner and Live Music Party!**\n\nStart your 
 weekend with a fun Friday night of great conversation\, new connections\, 
 dinner\, drinks and live music at Smoke Show!\n\nThis is a relaxed social 
 night designed for people who enjoy meeting others without the pressure of
  a formal singles event.\nCome on your own or bring a friend — we’ll h
 ave a friendly group ready to mix\, mingle and enjoy the evening together.
 \n\n🍽️ DINNER\, DRINKS & CONVERSATION\nWe’ll start the evening by g
 etting comfortable\, ordering some food and drinks\, and getting to know o
 ne another. Don’t worry if you’re coming alone — many people do! We
 ’ll help introduce people and get the conversations flowing.\n🎵 LIVE 
 MUSIC\nAs the evening gets going\, we’ll enjoy live music while continui
 ng to mix and mingle. You can sit back and listen\, chat with new friends\
 , grab another drink\, or move around and meet more people.\n🤝 MEET NEW
  PEOPLE\nThe idea is simple: get out of the house\, put the phones away fo
 r a while and enjoy some real face-to-face socializing. You never know who
  you might meet — a new friend\, someone to join you at future events\, 
 or perhaps someone special.\n\nNo pressure. No complicated agenda. Just a 
 fun Friday night with good food\, good music\, good conversation and good 
 company.\n\n**Arrival Time:**\n\\*Join us any time between 6:30 pm and 8:0
 0 pm (if you can) for a fun and highly interactive evening as we get to kn
 ow the members over dinner and great conversations (of your choice)\n\n**E
 vent Fee:**\n10 dollars (cash only please) (HST included)\nor in advance b
 y e transfer to **[steveflemming11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11@gmail
 .com/)**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminder:**\n\\
 *One beverage or appetizer minimum to support the venue- this is greatly a
 ppreciated :)\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
