SUMMARY:The Friday Night Disco Band and Dance Bash! 
DESCRIPTION:Try New Things in Toronto!\nHello everyone\,\n\nGet ready for 
 a fun Friday night of mingling\, dancing\, live music and great company at
  Smoke Show!\n\n\\*Remember to ask for Steve when you arrive-so they can p
 oint you to me and the group\n(you will be paying your fee to me not the o
 ther person at the front door-much appreciated)\n\n*\\*Joined by my other 
 social groups too so we can anticipate a fabulous turn out!*\n\n**Date:** 
 Friday\, September 25th 2026\n**Arrival Time:** Please arrive between 8:30
  p.m. -9:45 p.m. (if you can)\n**Where to Meet us?**\n**Location:** Smoke 
 Show\n**Address:** 744 Mt. Pleasant\n**Free Parking:** in Residential area
  and on Eglinton and Mt. Pleasant north of Eglinton\n**Eglinton and Mt. Pl
 easant Subway:** (Very close\, 1 minute walking distance)\n\nEvent Details
  Bellow:\n\nSincerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Detai
 ls:\n**The Friday Night Disco Band and Dance Bash!**\n\nIt’s time to tur
 n up the energy with a live band\, great music and plenty of dancing!\n\nW
 hether you come on your own or bring a friend\, this is all about having a
  relaxed\, social night where singles\, couples and friends can meet\, tal
 k\, laugh and enjoy the music together.\n\n💃 Dancing and great music\n
 🎸 Live band\n🎧 DJ and dance music\n🍽️ Food and drinks available
  for purchase\n🗣️ Plenty of time to mix and mingle\n😊 Friendly\, w
 elcoming social atmosphere\n👋 Come solo or bring some friends\n\nNo nee
 d to be a great dancer—just come ready to have some fun!\n\n**Arrival Ti
 me:**\n\\*Join us any time between 8:30 pm and 9:45 pm (if you can) for a 
 fun and highly interactive evening as we get to know the members over dinn
 er and great conversations (of your choice)\n\n**Event Fee:**\n10 dollars 
 (cash only please) (HST included)\nor in advance by e transfer to **[steve
 flemming11@gmail.com](http://steveflemming11@gmail.com/)**\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminder:**\n\\*One beverage or appetiz
 er minimum to support the venue- this is greatly appreciated :)\n\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
